{"3850950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Time to the Frontline", "steam_appid": 3850950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Temporal Vanguard</strong>, an elite squad from the <i>24th century</i>, as they travel through history to stop the <strong>Chronarchs</strong>—an alien force rewriting Earth's past to <i>erase</i> its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the <strong>Chronarchs</strong> begin invading weaker points in human history, Earth responds with its most advanced weapon yet: <i>time travel</i>. Lead <strong>Alexis</strong>, <strong>Jack</strong>, and <strong>Lucas</strong> across centuries—from <i>medieval Europe</i> <i>to</i> <i>futuristic</i> <i>warzones</i>—combining futuristic technology with old-world chaos to protect the <i>timeline</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6b65496e56f9a2581e6937376314df20.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6b65496e56f9a2581e6937376314df20.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6b65496e56f9a2581e6937376314df20.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Time to the Frontline</strong>, futuristic firepower clashes head‑on with blades and arrows. As you drop <i>photon grenades</i> into a muddy trench or unleash automatic <i>plasma bursts</i> against charging pikemen, the collision of <strong>sci‑fi and medieval</strong> warfare feels visceral rather than gimmicky. Some desperate villagers even side with the <strong>Chronarchs</strong>, wielding stolen alien weaponry alongside their steel swords, forcing you to adapt on every battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/176da882ff320825cf9b4134e69d56a8.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/176da882ff320825cf9b4134e69d56a8.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/176da882ff320825cf9b4134e69d56a8.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire campaign is built around <strong>three‑player co‑op</strong>, so you and two friends can tackle every mission together <i>from start to finish</i>. From the ramparts of a <i>crumbling fortress</i> to the steel corridors of an <i>alien stronghold</i>, every firefight becomes a pulse‑pounding test of teamwork and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/204e9adb9c38e3f88a1a4510d909f9f0.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/204e9adb9c38e3f88a1a4510d909f9f0.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/204e9adb9c38e3f88a1a4510d909f9f0.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <strong>Temporal Vanguard</strong> member’s <i>nanosuit</i> grants unique time‑bending powers that redefine combat. <i>Freeze</i> a charging battalion in mid‑stride, <i>rewind</i> a lethal misstep to carve a new strategy, or <i>accelerate</i> your movements to outflank foes—and that’s just the beginning. As you unlock new <strong>chronokinetic abilities</strong>, every encounter becomes a playground of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/8127fb196f1958881bb5ab19c659b434.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/8127fb196f1958881bb5ab19c659b434.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/8127fb196f1958881bb5ab19c659b434.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the firefights, <strong>Time to the Frontline</strong> weaves a weighty <strong>narrative</strong> that responds to your choices. Will you spare the townspeople who betrayed their kin to save themselves? Do you risk altering a pivotal battle for greater long‑term gain? Every decision ripples through the campaign, branching into <strong>new missions, alliances, and endings</strong> that reflect the burdens—and consequences—of playing with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/40b36aab9f21cbcf6d49c233c0ce66cd.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/40b36aab9f21cbcf6d49c233c0ce66cd.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/40b36aab9f21cbcf6d49c233c0ce66cd.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss encounters</strong> pitting you against <i>alien warlords</i> in power‑armored exosuits or monstrous <i>Chronarch constructs</i> that tower over medieval sieges. Each battle demands that you combine gunplay, time abilities, and environmental hazards—whether it’s collapsing drawbridges or gravity‑distortion fields—to top off every major story milestone with a truly memorable showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6874957b6def66e259f847c5a989c597.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6874957b6def66e259f847c5a989c597.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6874957b6def66e259f847c5a989c597.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey across eras, the world around you <i>shifts</i>. Villages recover or burn based on your interventions, enemy patrols reroute to counter your tactics, and secret objectives emerge only if you alter a key timeline event. This evolving “<strong>timeline impact</strong>” ensures that no two playthroughs feel identical and that the stakes of every mission stay as high as the centuries you’re fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>Temporal Vanguard</strong>, an elite squad from the <i>24th century</i>, as they travel through history to stop the <strong>Chronarchs</strong>—an alien force rewriting Earth's past to <i>erase</i> its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the <strong>Chronarchs</strong> begin invading weaker points in human history, Earth responds with its most advanced weapon yet: <i>time travel</i>. Lead <strong>Alexis</strong>, <strong>Jack</strong>, and <strong>Lucas</strong> across centuries—from <i>medieval Europe</i> <i>to</i> <i>futuristic</i> <i>warzones</i>—combining futuristic technology with old-world chaos to protect the <i>timeline</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6b65496e56f9a2581e6937376314df20.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6b65496e56f9a2581e6937376314df20.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6b65496e56f9a2581e6937376314df20.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Time to the Frontline</strong>, futuristic firepower clashes head‑on with blades and arrows. As you drop <i>photon grenades</i> into a muddy trench or unleash automatic <i>plasma bursts</i> against charging pikemen, the collision of <strong>sci‑fi and medieval</strong> warfare feels visceral rather than gimmicky. Some desperate villagers even side with the <strong>Chronarchs</strong>, wielding stolen alien weaponry alongside their steel swords, forcing you to adapt on every battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/176da882ff320825cf9b4134e69d56a8.poster.avif?t=1784