es, and environmental hazards—whether it’s collapsing drawbridges or gravity‑distortion fields—to top off every major story milestone with a truly memorable showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6874957b6def66e259f847c5a989c597.poster.avif?t=1784988352\" width=620 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6874957b6def66e259f847c5a989c597.webm?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/extras/6874957b6def66e259f847c5a989c597.mp4?t=1784988352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you journey across eras, the world around you <i>shifts</i>. Villages recover or burn based on your interventions, enemy patrols reroute to counter your tactics, and secret objectives emerge only if you alter a key timeline event. This evolving “<strong>timeline impact</strong>” ensures that no two playthroughs feel identical and that the stakes of every mission stay as high as the centuries you’re fighting for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Experience a battle for humanity’s survival in Time to the Frontline, a third-person shooter with fast‑paced combat, and in‑depth, narrative‑driven choices where soldiers travel through time to halt an alien invasion altering history. Fight between future wars to the Middle Ages, and shape fate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Italian, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/df5d610fdafd5595df5eae3fed63c1ca78fe88c8/header.jpg?t=1784988352", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/6030c12ffcb789617c5e9bb690b8eea028974439/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784988352", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850950/6030c12ffcb789617c5e9bb690b8eea028974439/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784988352", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 or AMD Radeon RX 580 (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended for faster load times</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700K or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT (8 GB VRAM or higher)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD strongly recommended</li></ul>"}, "m